  "description": "It was simply a contractual marriage, a marriage meant to produce a son, and there was no love between us. Then one day, Tae-Geom, who had been terrifyingly cold, began to change. The person who used to leave the master bedroom without a second thought after work now wanted to sleep in the same bed and brought me tickets to a concert by my favorite pianist.\n\nWhy was he suddenly acting like this?\nMy heart, which I'd thought dry, began to beat with renewed vigor.\n\nMaybe, just maybe, I could live happily with him... I harbored such a foolish hope.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8253105), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8870282)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11325556)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11325239)",
